\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces  2D representation of the plane partition heuristic. $p$ is the anchor point with $q$ a nearby point used to create the plane partition. The point $w$ is excluded by the plane partition heuristic as $q$ would be in the lune of $p$ and $w$. The point $u$ is not excluded by the plane partition heuristic, even if $q$ might fall within the lune created by $p$ and $u$ because $u$ falls below the plane partition. }}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
